# LIBRARY: own
# A step of an exact integer round a cycle of calls is guarded in a specialized version of the body, and the generic version behind it takes what is no int32: the second step of a round asks nothing.
# RUN: walk f1 mechanisms=all
# CHECK: code f1:Body
# CHECK: TypeTest v0 testedType=int[1, 2147483648]
# CHECK: Sub {{*}} form=Integers
# CHECK: StrictEq
# CHECK: Sub {{*}} form=Integers
# CHECK: CallDirect {{*}} function=f1
# CHECK: form=CheckedIntegers
# RUN(ANSWERS): run-in-shell mechanisms=all
# ANSWERS: true true -3 2147483646 -2147483651 -9007199254740992 9007199254740991
# ANSWERS-NEXT: exited with 0
